SetPoolFloor_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the admin
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is the admin
    ├── when the floor is below 500 whole tokens
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the floor is at least 500 whole tokens
        ├── it should store the floor
        └── it should emit {PoolFloorUpdated}
